{"PolicyName":"BlastRadius-IdleRemediation","Statement":[{"Action":["ec2:DescribeInstances","ec2:DescribeVolumes"],"Effect":"Allow","Resource":["*"],"Sid":"DescribeEverything"},{"Action":["ec2:StopInstances"],"Condition":{"StringEquals":{"aws:ResourceTag/idle":"true"}},"Effect":"Allow","Resource":["arn:aws:ec2:*:*:instance/*"],"Sid":"StopInstancesOnlyWhenTaggedIdle"},{"Action":["ec2:StartInstances"],"Condition":{"StringEquals":{"aws:ResourceTag/blastradius:managed":"true"}},"Effect":"Allow","Resource":["arn:aws:ec2:*:*:instance/*"],"Sid":"StartInstancesForRollback"},{"Action":["ec2:DeleteVolume"],"Condition":{"StringEquals":{"aws:ResourceTag/protected":"false"}},"Effect":"Allow","Resource":["arn:aws:ec2:*:*:volume/*"],"Sid":"DeleteUnprotectedVolumesOnly"},{"Action":["ec2:CreateVolume","ec2:CreateTags"],"Effect":"Allow","Resource":["arn:aws:ec2:*:*:volume/*"],"Sid":"RecreateVolumesForRollback"}],"Version":"2012-10-17"}